521	Table~\ref{tab:fol-detailed} traces the ISR collapse over training:
522	ISR$^*=0.642$ at 100 steps $\to$ $0.132$ at 500 steps ($-79.4$\%) $\to$ $0.003$ at 1000 steps ($-99.5$\% from step 100).
